# ==============================================================================
# Oops Capsule Synchronization Whitelist (.oopsallow)
# ==============================================================================
# Strict default-deny whitelist defining files and patterns permitted for
# bidirectional synchronization (push/pull) between the local capsule
# (/@<remote>/) and the remote host environment (~/oopsbox/).
#
# Rules:
# - Blank lines and lines starting with '#' are ignored.
# - Leading '/' anchors matching to the root of the capsule / remote workspace.
# - Glob wildcards ('*', '**') are supported.
# - Files not explicitly matched by any rule are DENIED by default.
# ==============================================================================

# Core Orchestration & Base Manifests
/.env
/compose.yaml
/oops.yaml
/common.yaml

# Remote Machine Overrides & Stack Overrides
/compose*.yaml

# Remote Configuration Trees (Full Streaming)
/config/**
